Value MODE ([*#+x-]?)
Value CONFIGURED (~?)
Value REMOTE ([0-9A-Fa-f:.]+)
Value VRF (\S+)
Value REFID (\S+)
Value STRATUM (\d+)
Value RECEIVE_TIME ([\d-]+)
Value POLL (\d+)
Value REACH (\d+)
Value DELAY ([\d.]+)
Value OFFSET ([-\d.]+)
Value JITTER ([-\d.]+)

Start
  ^\s*${MODE}${CONFIGURED}\s*${REMOTE}\s+vrf\s+${VRF}\s*$$ -> VrfRow
  ^\s*${MODE}${CONFIGURED}\s*${REMOTE}\s+${REFID}\s+${STRATUM}\s+${RECEIVE_TIME}\s+${POLL}\s+${REACH}\s+${DELAY}\s+${OFFSET}\s+${JITTER}\s*$$ -> Record

VrfRow
  ^\s+${REFID}\s+${STRATUM}\s+${RECEIVE_TIME}\s+${POLL}\s+${REACH}\s+${DELAY}\s+${OFFSET}\s+${JITTER}\s*$$ -> Record Start
